  steps:
  - initialDialog:
    - name: 12
      dialog: Thought I'd tag along this time... make sure ya don't get lost. Can't
        have ya driftin' off into some frozen rock, now can we?
    - name: 3
      dialog: Excellent. That'll save time on the rescue mission.
    - name: 3
      dialog: Phantoms won't take kindly to our presence. But it's one step closer
        to Earth.
    - name: 3
      dialog: Our next objective is the sector gateway at Genesis.
    - name: 19
      dialog: Of course, it won't be as simple as just showing up.
    - name: 18
      dialog: It never is...
